  },
  {
    q: "Which major North American cities observe Eastern Time?",
    a: "Major U.S. cities in Eastern Time include New York City, Washington, D.C., Boston, Philadelphia, Atlanta, Detroit, and Miami. Major Canadian cities include Toronto, Montreal, and Ottawa. All of these cities observe EST (UTC-5) in winter and EDT (UTC-4) in summer."
